{'symbol': 'ANSS', 'date': '2022-06-28 12:05:00', 'title': 'ANSYS JOINS INTEL FOUNDRY SERVICES CLOUD ALLIANCE TO ADVANCE SEMICONDUCTOR DEVELOPMENT', 'text': "ANSYS MULTIPHYSICS PLATFORM CHOSEN BY INTEL FOUNDRY SERVICES TO ENABLE SILICON PERFORMANCE AND RELIABILITY / KEY HIGHLIGHTS ANSYS® REDHAWK-SC™, ANSYS® HFSS™ AND OTHER MULTIPHYSICS ANALYSIS SOLUTIONS ARE SELECTED FOR INTEL FOUNDRY SERVICES' NEW CLOUD ALLIANCE INITIATIVE OPEN, INTEROPERABLE, SCALABLE NATURE OF ANSYS MULTIPHYSICS SOLUTIONS AND PLATFORM WILL ENABLE MORE COMPANIES TO ACCESS INTEL'S LEADING SILICON TECHNOLOGIES VIA THE CLOUD TO IMPROVE EFFICIENCIES PITTSBURGH , JUNE 28, 2022\xa0 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ANSYS\xa0(NASDAQ: ANSS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS JOINED THE INTEL FOUNDRY SERVICES\xa0(IFS) CLOUD ALLIANCE. IFS IS A FULLY VERTICAL, STANDALONE FOUNDRY BUSINESS ANNOUNCED BY INTEL LAST YEAR."}